SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 3 charge
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    K-mica 0 10
    Kaolinite 0 10
    Dolomite 0 10
    Epsomite 0 10
    Fe(OH)3(a) 0 10
    Halite 0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -high_precision true
    -totals Na Cl K Mg Ca Fe Al C S Si
USER_PUNCH
    -headings sc
    10 PUNCH SC